```console
$ scherzo-cloud run input-set upload --help
Upload members to a Run Input Set

Usage: scherzo-cloud run input-set upload [OPTIONS] --member-file <MEMBER> <PATH> <ORGANIZATION> <INPUT_SET>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <INPUT_SET>     Run Input Set ID

Options:
      --member-file <MEMBER> <PATH>    Upload a regular file as one exact logical member
      --json                           Print the run result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

Eligibility:
  The Run Input Set must still be open for uploads.

```
